      <div style="font-size: 13pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; opacity: 0.85;">Part 4</div>
      <h1 style="color: white; margin: 8px 0 4px 0; font-size: 24pt;">Artificial Intelligence & LLMs for .NET Developers</h1>
